q:
In this declaration, how is the delay dynamically computed across elements?
.item {
  animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 150ms);
}

c:
.item {
  animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 150ms);
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  ::view-transition-group(*),
  ::view-transition-old(*),
  ::view-transition-new(*) {
    animation: none !important;
  }
}

